__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.env
.ssh/

# Per-run private runtime. Durable public run evidence belongs in stages 01-07;
# role-private state and scratch never enter Git.
01_os/_runs/*/_runtime/

# Domain workflow runtime traffic is domain-owned under 01_os/07_content/_runs.
# Its per-run private runtime follows the same no-track rule.
01_os/07_content/_runs/*/_runtime/

# Claude Code agent settings.
#
# settings.json is TRACKED: it carries the shared policy (permissions, deny
# rules) and reaches every domain through a core merge, so one edit in core
# updates all of them.
#
# settings.local.json is NOT tracked. It holds one machine's personal choices -
# model, effort, thinking budget. It was tracked by mistake, which is how one
# person's 16k always-on thinking budget ended up cloned into every domain
# repository.
.claude/settings.local.json

# NBA2K22 integration 2026-11-03: keep large generated worlds and backups OFF GitHub.
# Existing tracked small research fixtures are unchanged by these ignore rules.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite.gz
*.sqlite.gz.part*
*.db
*.db.gz
*.db.gz.part*
*.tar.gz.part*
# Preserve tiny deterministic fixtures when explicitly added by task-approved tests.
!**/tests/fixtures/*.sqlite
!**/tests/fixtures/*.sqlite3
!**/tests/fixtures/*.db
!**/tests/fixtures/**/*.sqlite
!**/tests/fixtures/**/*.sqlite3
!**/tests/fixtures/**/*.db
# Native capture archives and large world capture output stay in offline archive.
**/06_执行/**/native_sources/*.tar.gz
**/06_执行/**/native_sources/*.tar.gz.part*
**/06_执行/**/native-sources.tar.gz.part*
**/06_执行/**/world-*.sqlite*
# Never commit a local-only archive or restored raw capture directory.
local_offline_archive/
local_offline_archives/
offline_worlddata_archive/

# Auto-generated bulk query exports are local-only; small deterministic tests/fixtures
# remain eligible for explicitly authorized commits outside raw 'queries' directories.
**/06_执行/**/queries/*.json
**/06_执行/**/queries/*.jsonl
**/06_执行/**/queries/*.jsonl.gz
**/06_执行/**/native_sources/*.jsonl
**/06_执行/**/native_sources/*.jsonl.gz
